        "original_id": "ce1002d2-2072-5789-8965-0d229c12473f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Slicked-up Pup, Tom and Jerry\n- People: William Hanna, Joseph Barbera, Fred Quimby\n- Topics: American animated short films, one-reel animated cartoons\n\nFacts:\n- In 1940, William Hanna and Joseph Barbera created Tom and Jerry as an American animated series of short films.\n- In 1951, Slicked-up Pup was released as an American one-reel animated cartoon.\n- Slicked-up Pup was the 60th Tom and Jerry cartoon directed by William Hanna and Joseph Barbera.\n- Fred Quimby produced Slicked-up Pup.",
